 "fields": {
  "field_sources": "for an entry built from searched sources, the URLs behind each filled column, keyed by the column name. A column is filled only where at least two independent publishers state the identical value (nba.com and the sites under it count as one publisher), judged on current listings only: the latest NBA, G League and team pages and current-season profiles. A college roster, a pre-draft profile, a past-season roster or an article's passing mention is set aside, and the note names what was. Where current listings disagree, or fewer than two state it, the column is left blank, and nothing is inferred from anything else. An undrafted man is written the way bio.csv writes one: PICK is UND, and DRAFT is his draft class year where two publishers state it.",
